er:1px solid #000; padding:12px; font-size:13.3px; font-weight:bold;\">\n                    Not for resale. If lost return to AGVS Enterprises Pvt. Ltd.\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
